La categoria "Pokemon" y la mascota actual de la aplicacion son recreaciones
pixel art realizadas con fines personales y educativos, basadas en personajes
registrados de Nintendo / Game Freak. Este proyecto no esta afiliado ni
patrocinado por Nintendo. Si el proyecto se publica con fines comerciales, esas
piezas deben sustituirse por disenos originales.

The "Pokemon" category and the current mascot are pixel-art recreations made for
personal and educational purposes, based on registered characters owned by
Nintendo / Game Freak. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by
Nintendo. If the project is published commercially, those pieces must be
replaced with original designs.
